WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-07 - The Weight We Carry
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.168
[Instrumental Intro — Somber Acoustic Guitar Picking & Resonant Piano Chord]

00:00:17.168 --> 00:00:25.069
Sometimes I look at the lines on your face

00:00:25.169 --> 00:00:33.931
And I see all the years in this terrible place

00:00:34.011 --> 00:00:42.500
I know what it costs you to stay by my side

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.732
The pieces of you that you're trying to hide

00:00:51.115 --> 00:00:58.500
Don't talk like it's a burden I didn't choose

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:07.500
There's nothing about you I'm willing to lose

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:15.500
It's heavy, it's hard, and it breaks me apart

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:24.500
But it's the only thing keeping a beat in my heart

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:32.000
The weight we carry is pulling us down

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:39.500
But we're holding our breath so we never drown

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:45.500
It's a beautiful anchor, a terrible chain

00:01:45.964 --> 00:01:52.489
It's the love that we found at the end of the pain

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:59.955
We won't let it fall, we won't let it go

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:07.000
It's the only gravity we'll ever know

00:02:22.647 --> 00:02:31.153
I hate that you can't have a life of your own

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:38.500
I hate that I need you to not be alone

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:43.500
But my life is right here in the dark of this room

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.800
We're flowers that only know how to bloom

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:52.200
In the shade of each other, away from the sun

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:56.800
When the rest of the world is all said and done

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:02.175
The weight we carry is pulling us down

00:03:02.175 --> 00:03:09.800
But we're holding our breath so we never drown

00:03:10.187 --> 00:03:18.293
It's a beautiful anchor, a terrible chain

00:03:18.373 --> 00:03:26.159
It's the love that we found at the end of the pain

00:03:26.199 --> 00:03:34.000
We won't let it fall, we won't let it go

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:40.360
It's the only gravity we'll ever know

00:03:43.985 --> 00:03:46.500
It's heavy...

00:03:47.629 --> 00:03:49.800
But I'm here.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:53.500
I'm not going anywhere.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:04:01.500
[Outro — Acoustic Guitar Fade]
